**Summary of Fix:**
- Added a new prop `errorMessageLabel` to `Item.propTypes`.
- Updated `getLabelForErrorMessage` to use `errorMessageLabel` if provided, otherwise fallback to the old logic.

This allows business code to explicitly set the error message label, even when the visible label is a custom DOM structure.
